## Protocol and specification text

- **Nostr Improvement Proposals** (NIP-01, NIP-05, NIP-07, NIP-15, NIP-16, NIP-17, NIP-22,
  NIP-44, NIP-46, NIP-51, NIP-52, NIP-57, NIP-59, NIP-60, NIP-61, NIP-85, NIP-89, NIP-99,
  NIP-115) are quoted and adapted in `docs/protocols/` and `docs/nip-publications/`.
  NIP text is in the public domain or MIT-licensed by its authors.
- **Colabonate Protocol Specification** (`docs/protocols/`) is MIT licensed. The canonical
  copy is maintained in
  [`Colabonate/Colabonate_Protocol`](https://github.com/Colabonate/Colabonate_Protocol).
- **Open Markets specification** (`https://github.com/OpenMarketsFoundation/specification`,
  MIT licence) is analysed in `docs/gamma-markets-analysis/` and quoted with attribution
  there. Our contributions to that workspace are made by pull request, not by copying its
  text into this repository.

## Category and taxonomy data

- `packages/data/categories/gamma-map-v1.json` and `gamma-map-v2.json` map the
  counterpart's commerce category vocabulary onto the Colabonate standard category axis
  (ADR-277, ADR-380). They are **derived data** and are covered by this repository's MIT
  licence; the source vocabulary belongs to the Open Markets specification and is
  referenced, not redistributed.

